DO Resolve absolute project, ticket_path, and estimate_path in active .inux; require files without
    reset. Batch independent reads/searches, reuse unchanged evidence, and keep routine checks
    quiet.

DO Read ticket.md/full estimate.md together; retain saved_estimate, ticket_id, and Boolean
    estimate_is_empty. Reject supplied-ID mismatch.

DO Set mode to "generate"/"improve"/"explain"/"publish"; bare estimate generates empty templates,
    otherwise improves. Unclear intent → NULL.

IF mode == NULL:
    ASK "Which estimate action do you want: generate, improve, explain, or publish?" AS clarified_request

    DO Resolve mode from clarified_request/original request; never infer publication intent.

IF mode == "improve":
    IF estimate_is_empty == TRUE:
        SET mode = "generate"

CHECK mode is one of "generate"/"improve"/"explain"/"publish".

IF mode == "generate":
    USE estimate/write.flow

IF mode == "improve":
    USE estimate/write.flow

IF mode == "explain":
    USE estimate/explain.flow

IF mode == "publish":
    USE estimate/publish.flow
